-- of the Laws of 2026: section 1422, critical safety incident reporting, with the
-- article's scope (section 1425), exceptions (section 1426) and the date it takes
-- effect (Chapter 96, sections 3 and 5).
--
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- New York law has read this against the source.
--
-- Seat: a frontier developer. Where a subdivision addresses only the office (within
-- the Department of Financial Services) or the Attorney General, it is encoded for
-- what it means to the developer, or recorded as inert.
-- Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/ny-s8828-2026-ch-96.txt (`src:N`).
